"""Shared state for one solo match. Every solo module reads and writes these types.

The match is server-authoritative. Humans and bots are both `Participant` and follow the same
movement, combat, inventory and elimination rules. Coordinates are metres on a flat map:
x east, y north, z height above ground. Nothing here is an original client field or packet.
"""

